1 OCCU Farmer/Bonde, Í Haukadal í Árnessýslu.
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "According to sources" - what sources?
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Bóndi í Haukadal. Þess hefur verið getið til að hann hafi verið faðir Kristínar, sem hafi átt Þorstein lögmann Eyjólfsson, en engin rök virðast fyrir því. Hann er einnig oft talinn faðir Árna hirðstjóra, en það virðist rangt. Samk
2 CONC væmt EB er hér ekki um að ræða son Kolbeins Auðkýlings, heldur var faðir hans Kolbeinn Þórðarson „kakali“. 
2 CONT _____________________________________
2 CONT A farmer in Haukadalur - He was NOT the father of Kristín, who was married to Þorsteinn law speaker Eyjólfsson, there are no arguments that confirm this connection. He is also often claimed to have been the father of Árni who was 
2 CONC the Captain of the Royal Court, but that seems to be incorrect. According to sources, this Þórður Kolbeinsson was not the son of Kolbeinn "Auðkýlingur", but the son of Kolbeinn Þórðarson "kakali".
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Bóndi í Haukadal
