2 CONT Guttorm Sigurdsson Tre-Liljer-Rogne-Torsnes b. in Torsnes.Jondalen.Hortdaland.Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Brynhild Sigurdsdatter Rogne b. in Torsnes.Jondal.Hordaland.Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Viking Sigurdsson Torsnes b. in Torsnes.Jondal.Hordaland.Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hallbjørn Sigurdsson Våge-Varaldsøy b. 1310 in Torsnes.Jondalen.Hordaland.Norway
