2 CONT * http://www.vulkaner.no/f/torgils.htm#torskebit
2 CONT * https://snl.no/Snorre_Torgrimsson
2 CONT * http://runeberg.org/nfcf/0091.html
2 CONT * http://www.grammaticalframework.org/~peter/simplypedia/simplypedia.cgi?site=svwiki&title=Snorre_gode
