1 NOTE Harald Sigurtharson - aka Harald Haardraade - was described as "...a
2 CONT handsome man of stately appearance.  With light blonde hair, blond beard,
2 CONT long mustaches, one eyebrow higher than the other.  With large hands and
2 CONT feet, and well-proportioned. He was ruthless with his enemies, and gave
2 CONT harsh punishment of all who opposed him, earning him the name "Hardruler =
2 CONT Haardraade."
