1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Kristin Toresdatter Bjarkøy Sørum=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Tore Håkonsson, baron and Ingebjørg Erlingsdatter Tandberg 
2 CONT * Kristina Toresdatter, born about 1285 on Bratsberg. [2840] She married [2841] (1) with Andres Bjarnesson. She married (2) with Iver Ogmundsen Rova. Ivar Ogmundson Rova f. Omk 1290, Occupation: Governor in Tønsberg and, G. Kristi
2 CONC ne Thorersdatter. Ivar died in 1350. Ivar Ogmundsson Rova may have been married to Rønnaug Smidsdtr., Daughter of Smid Eriksson.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: (1) '''Bjarkøyridder Andres Bjarnesson,''' who died already 1305, no children
2 CONT * Married: (2)  '''Andres Bjarnesson''', issue one daughter Kristine Andersdotter 
2 CONT * Married: (3)  '''The famous Hestbø knight and sheriff in Skien, Ivar Ogmunsson Rova,''' son of Agmund Sigurdsson of hestbø at Finnøy in Ryfylke. Mentioned in 1295 as a knight, later became Baron and Marker of Håkon V.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children with Andres Bjarnesson=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Kristine Andersdotter,''' death: between 1313 and 1314 - https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000007329033043?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000084409744857&position=0
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children of Ivar Ogmundsen HESBØ / ROVA and Kristina Thorersdatter=
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. '''Kristin / Kristina Ivarsdotter''', Born: Sauherad, Telemark, Death: Sauherad, Telemark, (1) med Andres Bjarnesson.  Hun giftet seg [2842] (2) med Iver Ogmundsen Rova.
2 CONT * 2. '''Cecilia Ivarsdatter ROVA,''' Born: Rova, Sauherad, Telemark, approx. 1295, Death: Nes Søndre, Gjerpen, Telemark, ca, med (1) with Torleiv Saksebjørnsson, born about 1295 at Lindheim in Sauherad, [2838] died before 1341. Sh
2 CONC e married [2839] (2) with Vetride Borgarsen
2 CONT
2 CONT =History=
