1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Skráning hefur verið lafærð / This profile has been corrected [by Anna Petursdottir]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE!  That Illugi and Ólöf had a relationship has always been speculative, but their alleged relationship has always been recorded in old records and manuscripts. Then women of her status got away with a lot of things - a lot mor
2 CONC e than other women of lower classes, so there is no reason to rule out the possibility that Illugi and Ólöf had a love affair and produced the two children they are supposed to have had [Anna Petursdottir].
2 CONT
2 CONT Sjá umfjöllun um Ólöfu, Illuga og son þeirra Sigurð langalíf hér: https://timarit.is/page/3552894?iabr=on#page/n19/mode/2up/search/sigvaldi
