1 NAME Kristin Sverresdatter /av Norge/
2 GIVN Kristin Sverresdatter
2 _MARNM av Norge
2 NICK (Christina)
1 NAME Kristín Sverrisdóttir
2 GIVN Kristín Sverrisdóttir
2 SURN
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1190
2 PLAC Norway - dtr of Sverre Sigurdsson
2 ADDR
