2 CONT (--?--) Aresdtr Fidja married Peder Reidulvsen Mandal, son of Reidulv (--?--) Mandal. She was born before 1535 at Fidja vestre, Lyngdal, Vest Agder, Norway. She was living in 1560 at Skoland, Lyngdal, Vest Agder, Norway. She died 
2 CONC after 1560 at Skoland, Lyngdal, Vest Agder,
2 CONT
