2 CONT
2 CONT Dette er eneste kjente barn av Jon Tollaksen Aukland (1). De andre tre som er oppført i bygdeboka for Hjelmeland (1b-1d) er barn av denne Tollak sin sønn Jon Tollakson Aukland (4). Dette framgår av en artikkel av Asgaut Steinnes i
2 CONC  Ætt og Heim 1961, se slektstavle II på side 63:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ætt og Heim 1961: https://www.nb.no/items/e0d07e44482002fdb30b8d6af76b03ad?page=63
2 CONT
2 CONT Tallak* JONSSON Aukland (766) (777)(767) was born in 1448 in Augland gård #8, Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway. He died about 1522 in Augland gård #8, Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway. He had an estate probated on 7 Jun 1522 in Norway. Ta
2 CONC llak Jonsson was a well-to-do farmer in Hjelmeland. His probate record is preserved, along with many other old documents, on the Aukland farm. Children were: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 130292 i. Jon* TALLAKSSON Aukland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. Gunnar TOLLAKSSON Øye(766) (777)(767) was born about 1490 in Augland gård #8, Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway. He died after 1549 in Øye farm, Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway. Gunnar Tollaksson appears to have first lived at Mjølhus
2 CONC  and later moved to Øye. He inherited 3 laupar smør at Hognestad in Jæren when his father died in 1522. Gunnar is mentioned in a list of persons fined by the court in 1519.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Skifte etter Tollak Jonson i 1522.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Hjelmeland  - Gardar og folk 1 side 104
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Tollak Jonson (1a). Skifte etter han i 1522.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: 
2 CONT * a. Jon, sjå nedanfor.
2 CONT * b.	Gunnar, Øye (6).
2 CONT * c.	Ei dotter, g.m. Ola Sevatson, Bandeberg, Jelsa (1).
