1 NOTE Alias: Ragnvaldsdatter
1 NOTE She was the mistress of King Olav Kyrre of Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT In Morkinskinna and in Fagerskinna, she is called Tora Arnesdatter; Snorre, Hrokkinskinna and Ryggjarstykket calls her Tora Jonsdatter; Thor A. Thorsteinsen, relying on Sunnmørsættlegga, proposes that she is the daughter of Jarl R
2 CONC agnvald Brusesson.
