2 CONT '''MAGNUS Minnesköld''' (-killed in battle near Lena 31 Jan 1208).  At Bjälbo.  “…B. dux…M. frater ducis B et filius eius Eskillus…” witnessed a charter dated to [1167/99] under which “Kanutus…Sweorum rex” donated property to the 
2 CONC monks of Juleta kloster[31].  “Byrgo Sweorum et Guttorum dux…Philippus frater meus, Magnus et Karolus fratres ducis…” witnessed a charter dated to [1167/99] under which “K…Sweorum rex filius Herjcjs itjdem regis” donated property 
2 CONC to Nydala kloster[32].  m firstly ---.  The name of Magnus´s first wife is not known.  '''married secondly INGRID [Ylva]''' ---.  
2 CONT
