2 CONT ==Reidar Sendemann (English: Messenger) was a solider that were in service of the Roman Emperor Alexios III Angelos where he served in the Varangian Guard. He later became a messenger which was an honorable position in the Roman t
2 CONC imes. He fought civil wars as Chieftain in Norway and later returned to Constantinople until he passed in 1214 in Constantinople (Today: Istanbul). The Eastern Roman Empire is what we today refer to as The Byzantine Empire. ==
