1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Svale Ølversson''' - ukjent opphav. Ridder og riksråd 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Opphav ukjent==
2 CONT Les artikkel av Lars Løberg: http://www.rogalandslag.org/Files/Kings&Queens910227.pdf "Another error is made when the author claims that Svale Ølverson was a member of the Rømer family. His only connection to the Rømers was that h
2 CONC e became the father–in–law of Otte Rømer, the same relationship that he had to Jon Jalvardson Smjor. We know at present nothing about the ancestry of Svale Ølverson, so his name will in any case be a dead end in the family tree."
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT ''Benekestokene og Rømerne eide i bygården Galgen i Bergen, som også Svale Ølversson eide''  [http://forum.arkivverket.no/topic/130697-45237-bergiut-torlevisdatters-formoedre-og-fedre/page-6]
2 CONT --------------------
