2 CONT Title: Hebnes 
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Åge Olavsson lived at Hebnes in Jelsa in 1563. That year he paid 7
2 CONT
2 CONT dalar in tax for property he owned and 1 dalar for property that he
2 CONT
2 CONT rented. Åge and his brother were operating the Hebnes Storstov farm,
2 CONT
2 CONT which had a value of 2 laupar smør 18 spann grain. Åge Olavsson was
2 CONT
2 CONT descended from the Losna family and married into the Koll family.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sometime around 1570 he married Jakob Koll's widow (Lena Olavsdatter)
2 CONT
2 CONT and went to live at Indre Nessa in Nedstrand.
2 CONT
