2 CONT
2 CONT source; https://www.nb.no/items/f77e326eead5336d2172d7a438f4800d?page=127 (175)
2 CONT and; https://www.nb.no/items/f77e326eead5336d2172d7a438f4800d?page=117 (147)? 
