2 CONC krá (1930), Bjarni Þorsteinsson, Guðný Bjarnadóttur, Þorstein Helgason, and Bjarni Þorsteinsson, (Reykjavík : Prentsmiðjan Acta H.F., 1930), FHL book 929.24912 T398t., p. 429. ↑ Egils saga Skallagrímssonar (filmed 1948), Valdimar 
2 CONC Ásmundsson, (Manuscript. Salt Lake City, Utah : Filmet av the Genealogical Society of Utah, 1948), FHL film 73,228 item 5., pt. 3, p. 6.
2 CONT
