1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Gyrd Haraldsson''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Bosatt i Norge ?'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * f. ca 850 Han var sønn av Harald Gyrdsson, moren er ukjent 
2 CONT * Gyrd var gift med Ukjent Thorolfsdotter, de hadde en datter
2 CONT * Gyrd ble drept av svensken Thormod den Sterke 
2 CONT
2 CONT 182. Thormod den Stærke hed en svensk mand; han dræbte Gyrd, der var morfader til Skjalg på Jæren. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gyrðr  Tilnavn / fordanskning: Gyrd  Lokalitet: Norge? Relationer: Morfader til Skjalg på Jæren. Dræbt af en svensk mand, som hed Thormod den Stærke. Kilder: Landnamabogen: 182 Noter: http://heimskringla.no/wiki/Landnamabogen
2 CONT
2 CONT ===========================
2 CONT BING TRANSLATION:
2 CONT
2 CONT Resident in Norway?
2 CONT
2 CONT b. around 850 He was the son of Harald Gyrdsson, mother unknown
2 CONT Gyrd was married to Unknown Thorolfsdotter, they had a daughter
2 CONT Gyrd was killed by the Swede Thormod the Strong
2 CONT 182. Thormod the Strong was a Swedish man; he killed Gyrd, who was the maternal grandfather of Skjalg of Jæren.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gyrðr Nickname / Danish version: Gyrd Location: Norway? Relations: Maternal grandfather of Skjalg of Jæren. Killed by a Swedish man named Thormod the Strong. Sources: Landnamabogen:
