2 CONT ii)         ASTRID Ogmundsdatter .  Snorre names "Astrid, Ogmund's daughter" as the mother of "Karl Sonason"[200].  m SUNE Ivarsson .  A Swedish official.  Sune & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT
