2 CONT      Thorfinn Jamoforloney, Jarl of Orkney and Caithness was born circa 1009.1 He was the son of Sigurd II Digri, Jarl of Orkney and Caithness and Donalda of Alba.1 He married Ingibiorg 'Earl's Mother' Finnsdottir, daughter of Fin
2 CONC n Arnasson, Jarl of Halland and Bergljot, before 1038.2 He died between 1056 and 1065.1 
2 CONT      Thorfinn Jamoforloney, Jarl of Orkney and Caithness gained the title of Jarl of Orkney.2 He gained the title of Earl of Caithness.2 
