2 CONC ited the aid of Jarl Thorfinn´s sons Páll and Erlendr”[903].  Orkneyinga Saga records that Magnus "Barelegs" King of Norway “seized the Earls, Paul and Erlend” on his arrival in Orkney, “sent them east to Norway, and made his own 
2 CONC son Sigurd overlord of the islands with regents to govern the earldom”, adding in a later passage that Erlend “had died and been buried at Trondheim”[904].  He was deposed and imprisoned in 1098 by [http://www.geni.com/people/Magn
