2 CONT    king of Scotland (1093/94), son of Malcolm III and grandson of DuncanI. For many years (1072/87) Duncan lived as a hostage of the NormanEnglish, allegedly as a confirmation of his father's homage to William Iof England. He beca
2 CONC me king of the Scots while driving out his uncle,Donald Bane, in 1094, an enterprise in which he was helped by someEnglish and Normans. He was killed at the
