2 CONT King Eric III's servant.  Riddar, riksråd, syslemann, høvedsmann og fehirde.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eindride Erlendsson of Losna, knighted in Kalmar, Sweden, 1397, is mentioned as queen Margarets "right hand" 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1405 the young king Eric instructed by queen Margrete appointed Eindride Erlendsson Losna to commander of Akershus castle and Fortress 
