1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Olaf Haldorssøn (15th century – c. 1535)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Biography''':
2 CONT * '''Origin''': The fourth son of Haldor Reidulfssøn.
2 CONT * '''1513''': Co-sealed a letter regarding Lande in Sandsvær on March 11 (DN. XVI 352).
2 CONT * '''1519''': Confirmed Gunhild Haavardsdtr's gift to Jon Nilssøn.
2 CONT * '''1523''': Mentioned as the owner of the Nordre Hoen farm in Eker (DN. VIII 513).
2 CONT * '''1533''': Co-sealed an exchange of a mill waterfall at Holmefos (DN. VII 683).
2 CONT * '''Property''': He must have owned the noble seat farm Ulleland in Eker.
2 CONT * '''Death''': He likely died around 1535. His widow remarried c. 1540 to Arne Gudulfssøn (DN. VII 733).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''':
2 CONT # Thore — co-owner of Nordre Hoen in 1523.
2 CONT # Gudrun — married to Olaf Sigurdssøn at Kjeldaas.
2 CONT # Reidar — bailiff (lensmand) at Eker c. 1540–1555.
2 CONT # Thorgeir — mentioned from 1542 onwards.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources''':
2 CONT # Diplomatarium Norvegicum (DN): DN. XVI 352, DN. VIII 513, DN. VII 683, DN. VIII 747, DN. VII 733, DN. VII 754.
2 CONT # Norsk tidsskrift for genealogi (1908), Vol. 1, No. 3, pp. [https://www.nb.no/items/e10dd023f88a4b86e782b2a2173a9e52?page=7&searchText=Olaf%20Haldorssøn 166-167].
2 CONT
2 CONT ——————
2 CONT
2 CONT Olaf Haldorssøn fastslår grensene S.- og N. Hoen med sine sønner i 1523. S.Hoen har sag og mølle. Laksefiske til begge gårder. Eier: N.Hoen, Ulleland Død ca. 1535. Enke ca. 1540 gm eieren av N Speren på Eker Arne Gudulfssøn som me
2 CONC d «sin søn» Thore Olufssøn i 1541 selger til Peder Litle en fos i Fossesholm
