0 @N6000000006127355267@ NOTE Axel Pedersen till Härlöf i Skåne, danskt riksråd, död julen 1446 som hövitsman på Varbergs slott, far till Axelssönerna, som spelade en mycket betydande politisk roll i Sverige under senare hälften av 1400-talet och bland vilka e
1 CONC n blevriksföreståndare två gånger.Thott, svenska adliga ätter, som är grenar av den gamla danska ätten Tott, av vilken en medlem, Tord Aagesen, nämns redan 1288. En medlem av ätten, danska riksrådet Axel Pedersen (Tott) till Härlö
1 CONC v i Skåne (död julen 1446 som hövitsman på Varbergsslott), var gift två gånger med förnäma svenska damer, först med Cathrine Krognos och sedan med Ingeborg Ivarsdotter. Han blev ryktbar i Nordens historia genom sina 9 söner
0 @N6000000000945043614@ NOTE Var væpner og kom fra den danske ætten Kyrning som førte tre sjøblad i kløvd skjod. Eide Farløf.  (Opplysninger fra Elgenstierna).
0 @N6000000000129985411@ NOTE From Kymm Smoothy - Also reported to be born on Onsrud farm.Gisle Amundsen may have been Ragndid Geirlaugsdatter's secondmarriage. A Gisle Amundsen witnessed in 1386 that his sisterAngunna Amundsdatter of Jaer in Nannestad sold 18
1 CONC  Oyresbol inSouth Vaagstad in Nes. It is likely that this Gisle of Hafstadin Nannestad, who was named in 1369 and 1392 and was a jury manin the district in 1386 may have had a connection to theGeirlaug family and Gisle family whic
1 CONC h is covered below. Thereis one communication that Geirlaug was connected to the Gislefamily. Geirlaug had a connection with Nannestad where he ownedthe whole of Hynne and it is therefore possible that hisdaughter was married in N
1 CONC annestad.Ambjørg Gislesdatter wasprobably his daughter. She was married to Peter Jute and isnamed in 1378 and1402 (DN III 454 and 562). One of theirdaughters, Tora Petersdatter was married to Haftor Finkelsson atFolberg in Nes who
1 CONC  was owner of Os in Sør-Odal. Gisle is alsomentioned in 1392. He was probably also father to GeirlaugGislesson,who in 1463 is named as a law man in Odalen. GisleAmundsen lived in about 1400 and had a son. Geirlaug Gislesen, .He wa
1 CONC s probably the operator of Seim farm in Sor Odal, but inany case his son Gisle Geirlaugsen was the operator later. Type- Book- Periodical: Sources - Bygdebokker NO2-176,177 Nes PaaRomerike
